 if INPUT_MISC
 
+config INPUT_S5L8702_N25_CLICKWHEEL
+	bool "Apple iPod Classic N25 click wheel"
+	depends on ARCH_S5L87XX && I2C
+	help
+	  Enable the S5L8702 click-wheel controller used by the Apple iPod
+	  Classic N25 family.  The driver follows Rockbox's controller setup
+	  and packet format, reports the five physical buttons and wheel as
+	  Linux input events, polls only the PCF50635 GPIOSTAT Hold bit, and
+	  disables the wheel clock while Hold is locked.
+
+	  This driver does not register the generic PCF50635 MFD or any storage
+	  peripheral.
+
